            </note>
            <note corresp="#d38-f2" n="2" xml:id="d38-f2-content">
                <p>NSC Action No. 400, approved December 14, 1950,
                    suspended the provisions of paragraph 4 of NSC
                    10/2, at the request of the Director of Central Intelligence, until the issuance
                    of a further directive. (National Archives, RG 59, S/S–NSC (Miscellaneous) Files: Lot 66 D 95, Records of Action by the
                    National Security Council)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d38-f3" n="3" xml:id="d38-f3-content">
